  "description": "A cosy old space station high above a blue-green planet, spread across up to three screens. In the middle the station with its greenhouse dome full of trees and warmly glowing windows; on the left the sun rising over the planet's edge; on the right a little ship by a docking module. With two screens: the station on the left, the ship on the right. With one screen: the station. The station floats and slowly turns, its windows flicker and its navigation lights blink, clouds drift across the planet, the stars twinkle and a faint nebula drifts by. Little shuttles fly seamlessly from one screen to the next. Move the mouse to see the layers shift in depth, click to launch a shuttle. Sunlight and station lights pulse to your music.",
